"Put a range in square brackets: [001-100] keeps three digits, [1-100] does not, [a-z] uses letters and [0-100:5] counts in fives. Several ranges multiply." = "Kuhi i tētahi awhe i roto i ngā kōwae tapawhā: [001-100] e pupuri ana i ngā mati e toru, [1-100] kāore, [a-z] e whakamahi ana i ngā tuhipoka me [0-100:5] e tatau ana i ngā rima. He maha ngā awhe e whakarea ana.";
